# Copy to .env.local and fill in what you need. All values are optional:
# the app degrades gracefully to deterministic, clone-only analysis.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub platform stats (stars, forks, open issues, watchers, topics)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional. Without it the app uses the anonymous GitHub API (60 requests/hour
# per IP) and cannot read private repositories.
# Create one at: https://github.com/settings/tokens (read-only "public_repo" is enough)
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI analysis (Overview narrative + the Deep Analysis report)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional. Powers two things from the same computed facts:
#   - a short narrative on the Overview "Project Purpose" card, and
#   - the full Deep Analysis page: architecture, data flow, domain model,
#     key modules and risks, derived from the import graph, routes, models,
#     config and selected file excerpts.
# Generated once per commit and cached with the analysis. When no key is set,
# the Overview falls back to the deterministic template summary and the Deep
# Analysis page renders a deterministic report from the same source facts —
# nothing breaks, it just has less narrative reasoning.

# Option A — OpenAI (or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint)
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# Option B — Anthropic
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=https://api.anthropic.com

# Shared overrides for either provider
# LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# LLM_BASE_URL=
